---
ns: archive
---
{#
  archive.njk — archive 列表页（SPEC.md §6.3）

  与 work 页的四点差异（已逐条实测确认）：
    · `li` **无任何类**、无筛选、无卡片视图、无底部按钮
    · 全部 `target="_blank"` 外链，行尾多一个 `.arrow` 外链指示
    · `ul` 是 `work-items mouse-pos-list-archive`（work 是 `…-image-wrap all-active`）
    · 标题里的计数是 `(66)`（带括号），work 页的 Archive 按钮是 `66`
  `(66)` 的**数值从数据派生**（`archiveCount`，`DEVIATIONS.md` B8）；括号是原站标记，留在此处。
#}
<header class="section default-header work-header archive-header" data-scroll-section>
{% include "partials/nav-bar.njk" %}   <div class="container medium">
      <div class="row">
         <div class="flex-col once-in">
            <h1><span>Archive <div class="count-nr">({{ archiveCount }})</div></span></h1>
         </div>
      </div>
   </div>
</header>
<section class="section-wrap section-wrap-work once-in archive-work-grid" data-scroll-section>
   <section class="section work-grid tiny-work-grid">
      <div class="container">
         <div class="grid-sub-title">
            <div class="flex-col">
               <h5>Client</h5>
            </div>
            <div class="flex-col">
               <h5>Location</h5>
            </div>
            <div class="flex-col">
               <h5>Services</h5>
            </div>
            <div class="flex-col">
               <h5>Year</h5>
            </div>
         </div>
         <ul class="work-items mouse-pos-list-archive">
{%- for item in archive.items %}
                        <li>
               <div class="stripe animate"></div>
               <a href="{{ item.href }}"{% if item.target %} target="{{ item.target }}"{% endif %} class="row">                  <div class="flex-col">
                     <h4><span>{{ item.name }}</span></h4>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex-col animate">
                     <p>{{ item.location }}</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex-col animate">
                     <p>{{ item.services }}</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex-col animate">
                     <p>{{ item.year }}</p>
                  </div>
{%- if item.arrow %}
                  <div class="arrow">{% include "partials/icon-arrow.njk" %}</div>
{%- endif %}
               </a>            </li>
{%- endfor %}
                        <div class="stripe last animate"></div>
         </ul>
      </div>
   </section>
</section>
{% include "partials/footer-rounded.njk" %}
{% include "partials/footer.njk" %}
